2741	Q0	zis58	57	3.5821714	instruments_tools	The scale measures anomie the perceived normlessness with four items. The development of the items is based on the work of Srole 1956 . The scale was used several times in a general population survey called Allgemeinen Bevölkerungsumfrage ALLBUS .
