43910	Q0	zis151	76	5.292058	instruments_tools	The items documented here capture emotional affective dimensions of identification with one s own nation and thus a central dimension of self group orientations. A positive development of such orientations is a prerequisite for national identity and patriotic attitudes. In extreme cases however they can also favour the formation of nationalistic values or ethnocentric tendencies which according to empirical studies are often associated with generalised negative prejudices and intolerance towards members of certain population groups institutions or states.
